This repository is a fork of that project. It retains the upstream
multi-engine application and adds a native KohakuMossTrainer CLI
adaptation. The upstream trainer is installed separately by each user,
is not modified by this fork, and is not included in this repository.

Modified files relative to the upstream baseline (6d5f6de):

  adapters/kohaku_moss_trainer/adapter.py
  adapters/kohaku_moss_trainer/params.py
  adapters/kohaku_moss_trainer/progress.py
  app/api/models.py
  app/api/server.py
  app/services/training.py
  frontend/src/api/index.ts
  frontend/src/features/draftStore.ts
  frontend/src/features/trainingExport.ts
  frontend/src/pages/NewTrainingPage.vue
  frontend/src/pages/ResultsPage.vue
  frontend/src/pages/TasksPage.vue
  frontend/src/types/api.ts
  supervisor/worker.py
  tests/test_functionality.py
  tests/test_kohaku_moss_adapter.py (new)
  README.md
  README.zh-CN.md
  NOTICE (this file, new)

Summary of changes: generate the training config with the official
`kohakumoss-config new train` and append only explicit user overrides;
inherit official VRAM/quantization defaults (INT8 ConvRot is not
dequantized); record explicit overrides end to end; add the MOSS task
progress/artifacts UI; document the adaptation and its experimental
status.

The fork is maintained independently and is not an official release of
the upstream project.
